	(text "MW7211A hub (upstream from the 74HC4052 on the USB sheet) drives all four ports: two stacked SS-52100-004 (J12 = hub P0/P1, J10 = hub P2/P3).\nEach port: CH217K current-limited switch (as dino_z80) + USBLC6 ESD behind the pins. Red LED = over-current on any port (shared USB_OC).\nPower budget: 4 ports x 0.5A = 2A on top of ~0.8A for the rest (CH217K limit ~0.6A per port, R = 100K).\nOn USB-C power the whole board is limited to 1.5A (F1 hold)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 168.91 31.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "52edc35d-bc65-488a-af8f-1ebc93c50a97")
	)
	
